#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry angles. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit.Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Variable R:realType. Section ArcMeasureTheorem. Variable O:R^2; r:R; Hypothesis r_pos:0<r. Variables B S U T V:R^2. Hypotheses B_on: `|B-O|=r; S_on: `|S-O|=r; U_on: `|U-O|=r; T_on: `|T-O|=r; V_on: `|V-O|=r. Variable R_pt:R^2. Hypotheses angle_SRU: angle S R_pt U = 23%:R; angle_TVU: angle T V U = 68%:R. Definition arc_measure P Q := let theta:= angle (P - O) (Q - O) in theta * 180/PI. Theorem opposite_arcs_sum: arc_measure S U + arc_measure T V = 360 - (23 + 68). Proof. by []. Qed. End ArcMeasureTheorem.
